/godotengine/godot/pull/106733.patch","merged_at":"2025-05-26T16:30:23Z"},"body":"As a modern game engine, it is important to have the bestest of rainbows.\r\n\r\nRichTextLabel [`[rainbow]`](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/latest/tutorials/ui/bbcode_in_richtextlabel.html#rainbow) uses the HSV color space. HSV is an old color space, and creates unsightly gradients.\r\n\r\nI changed it to use OkHSV instead, which is a similar, but more pleasing, alternative.\r\n\r\n## Old:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f0e46728-d87d-4d50-9faa-01cef57eb29e\r\n\r\n\r\n## New:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/48b8145d-5126-4004-b75b-103fc69b3a1c\r\n\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106733/reactions","total_count":19,"+1":11,"-1":0,"laugh":8,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106733/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}